  "title": "Bacon-Cheddar Cauliflower Chowder",
  "description": "This creamy, bacon-Cheddar cauliflower chowder recipe is a great alternative to potato chowder. Sharp Cheddar cheese and bacon really amp up the flavor.",
  "authors": [
